{"headword":"חֵן²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup>ψ 45:3</sup> <strong>favour, grace</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:8\" href=\"/Genesis.6.8\">Gn 6:8</a> + 67 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חִנּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:21\" href=\"/Genesis.39.21\">Gn 39:21</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>favour, grace, elegance:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"of <em>form and appearance</em>, of a woman ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹ֑פִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.30\">Pr 31:30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵשֶׁת חֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.16\">Pr 11:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">זונה טובת חן</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:4\" href=\"/Nahum.3.4\">Na 3:4</a>; of a doe <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.19\">Pr 5:19</a>; precious stone <span dir=\"rtl\">אבן חן</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.8\">Pr 17:8</a>; of ornaments <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.9\">Pr 1:9</a> = <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.9\">4:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:32\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.32\">3:22</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of <em>speech</em>, lips <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:3\" href=\"/Psalms.45.3\">ψ 45:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.11\">Pr 22:11</a>; words <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:12\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.12\">Ec 10:12</a>."}],"num":"b."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>favour, acceptance:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>with men</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.15\">Pr 13:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.1\">22:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 9:11\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.9.11\">Ec 9:11</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>with God</em> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 4:7\" href=\"/Zechariah.4.7\">Zc 4:7</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 12:10\" href=\"/Z